name: The Arm — hand level down
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Arm decreases the level of the played poker hand by 1. Ante 2 boss: commit to a
  high-level hand and use Space Joker or Supernova to counter.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheArm
    antes: [2]
should:
  - joker: SpaceJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Supernova
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
